# LANDFALL: a blast on bog makes a teleporting pair: one bog tile in the
# blast and another bog tile somewhere on the planet (even down in the
# dungeon) link up, and stepping on one puts her on the other. One pair at
# a time: a new one turns the old pair back into plain bog.
game landfall
wait 5
cheat nomobs
cheat planet 2
expect alltiles11 > 10
expect warp_rooms == 0
cheat tile 10 5 11
cheat hold 3 5
cheat res 0 3
cheat pos 139 82
press A
hold LEFT 50
wait 60
expect warp_rooms == 2
expect tile_10_5 == 12
expect alltiles12 == 2
expect hp == 3
# onto it: somewhere else
hold RIGHT 66
expect warps == 1
expect room != 31
expect alltiles12 == 2
# off it and back on: home again, beside the ship
hold UP 14
expect room == 4
hold DOWN 14
expect room == 31
expect warps == 2
# a new blast on bog: the old pair is plain bog again
cheat tile 3 5 11
cheat pos 30 82
press A
hold RIGHT 50
wait 60
expect alltiles12 == 2
expect tile_3_5 == 12
expect tile_10_5 == 11
